{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":15.6},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.8,"end":32.08},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.88,"end":46.56}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.6,"text":"包含式 OR 在至少一個輸入為真時成立，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.92,"end":5.76,"text":"也包含兩者都真。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.64,"end":9.36,"text":"它可表示替代授權途徑。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":9.68,"end":12.72,"text":"日常的二選一可能聽起來互斥，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.88,"end":15.6,"text":"因此必須明確寫出真值規則。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.8,"end":17.52,"text":"警報關閉，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.84,"end":18.72,"text":"切換 OR，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":19.12,"end":20.48,"text":"重測四組輸入。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.2,"end":22.48,"text":"特別注意 11，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.72,"end":26.24,"text":"不要假設二選一代表只能有一個真。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":27.88,"end":30,"text":"A = 1、B = 1 時，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":30.48,"end":32.08,"text":"包含式 OR 是多少？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.88,"end":36.24,"text":"A = 1、B = 1 時，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.72,"end":38.4,"text":"包含式 OR 是多少？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.6,"end":43.2,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":43.92,"end":46.56,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}